@page "/"

<PageTitle>CivicBudget</PageTitle>

<div class="cb-login">
    <div class="cb-login-left">
        <div class="cb-eyebrow" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)">A portfolio project</div>
        <h1>Budgeting and public transparency for local governments.</h1>
        <p>CivicBudget lets a city, village, township, or county build its annual budget and publish it to citizens through a fast, accessible portal. It models Ohio governmental fund accounting: funds, departments, a chart of accounts, and the rule that appropriations may not exceed estimated resources.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><b>Admin app:</b> two budget-entry modes, live fund balances, a Draft to Adopted workflow, amendments, and a field-level audit trail.</li>
            <li><b>Public portal:</b> citizens browse the adopted budget with no login. It reads only published snapshots, never drafts.</li>
            <li><b>Stack:</b> .NET 10, Blazor, EF Core, SQL Server, ASP.NET Core Identity, AWS CDK.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-auto small" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)">All data is fictional. Village of Maple Ridge, Ohio, does not exist.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cb-login-right">
        <div class="card cb-login-card">
            <div class="card-body p-4">
                <AuthorizeView>
                    <Authorized>
                        <h2 class="h5 mb-1">Welcome back</h2>
                        <p class="text-secondary small mb-3">Signed in as <b>@(context.User.FindFirst(ClaimNames.DisplayName)?.Value)</b>.</p>
                        <a class="btn btn-primary w-100" href="admin">Open the admin app</a>
                    </Authorized>
                    <NotAuthorized>
                        <h2 class="h5 mb-1">Try the demo</h2>
                        <p class="text-secondary small mb-3">Sign in as the fiscal officer, a department head, or a viewer to see each role's view. Demo logins are in the README.</p>
                        <a class="btn btn-primary w-100" href="Account/Login">Sign in</a>
                    </NotAuthorized>
                </AuthorizeView>
                <hr>
                <p class="small text-secondary mb-2">Or see what citizens see:</p>
                <a class="btn btn-outline-primary w-100" href="transparency/maple-ridge-oh">Maple Ridge transparency portal <span class="cb-code small">(Phase 5)</span></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
